# Frontend build tooling — never commit installed deps or an npmrc/lockfile that
# could pin a private registry URL. The BUILT output (../internal/webui/dist) IS
# committed so the Go binary embeds it and `go build`/`install.sh` need no npm.
node_modules/
.npmrc
package-lock.json
npm-shrinkwrap.json
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
*.tsbuildinfo
